<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus H1 up 16.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus H1 up 16.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     386  vs	     331</p>
<p>    Operating					855  vs	     725</p>
<p>    Net, pre-exceptional			 582  vs	     490</p>
<p>    Exceptional losses			    31  vs		81</p>
<p>    Financial gain				  62  vs		61</p>
<p>    Turnover				     5,438  vs	   5,022</p>
<p>NOTE - Canal Plus gave the figures in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
